104
00:04:02,580 --> 00:04:02,906
ROB:

105
00:04:02,906 --> 00:04:07,146
It'd be good to go into past mistakes in a bit more detail.

106
00:04:07,146 --> 00:04:11,713
Did you read that case study of the problems there were in New Orleans

107
00:04:11,713 --> 00:04:13,670
